{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f95b7dd52f026149","name":"Horned Kath Hound","source":{"id":"source:reference-f95b7dd52f026149","title":"Horned Kath Hound","revision":21615,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:08:59Z","sha256":"d3741043890ad118969ffadf64269b2bdfa20708717cd1041e536790e8aa1c07","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21615","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Horned%20Kath%20Hound&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f95b7dd52f026149","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Creatures of KOTOR"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Creatures_of_KOTOR"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Horned Kath Hounds are more dangerous and aggressive versions of the mundane ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kath Hound"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kath_Hound","referenceId":"reference:b6155e97a22e5692"}," found on the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dantooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dantooine","referenceId":"reference:c24e970214f5ff8b"},". Horned Kath Hounds attack with a combination of their horns and sharp claws, reserving their bite for chewing up prey. Horned Kath Hounds usually travel in their own packs, but some serve as the alpha for a group of regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kath Hounds"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kath_Hounds"},", cowing them into submission. Horned Kath Hounds are not subtle hunters and prefer bowling over prey with a mighty charge before goring and clawing their victim to death. They are notoriously tough creatures with thick hides that can deflect all but the best placed attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Horned Kath Hound Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Horned Kath Hounds appear anywhere on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dantooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dantooine","referenceId":"reference:c24e970214f5ff8b"}," where large amounts of prey- typically ",{"tag":"a","children":["Iriaz"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Iriaz","referenceId":"reference:fd9c73570577e364"},"- can be found. When hunting, they lurk on the fringes of large herds of prey. Otherwise, they stick to the ravines and low rolling hills of the planet, digging dens to raise their pups. Horned Kath Hounds are also favored as cruel guard animals or pets by criminals or other individuals who admire the vicious nature of these beasts.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Horned Kath Hound Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 7\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 15), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 14, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 52, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 14\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children